DOMAIN,ad.tencentmusic.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,ads.service.kugou.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,adsfile.kugou.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,mdpfilebssdlbig.kugou.com,REJECT
